+	 * Target a mid-grey in display space.  The softisp now applies the
+	 * sRGB transfer, so a raw mean of ~20% (200/1023) reconstructs to a
+	 * ~120/255 midtone; the old 460 target assumed a linear pipeline and
+	 * would over-expose once the gamma is applied.
+	 */
